{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "TMR10-2415WIR",
 "kind": "power_module",
 "manufacturer": "Traco Power",
 "title": "TMR 10WI: 10 W isolated DC-DC converter in SIP-8, 4:1 input, single and dual outputs",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. April 28, 2026",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A family of eighteen regulated, isolated 10 W DC-DC modules in an 8-pin single-in-line through-hole case of 21.8 × 9.6 × 12.0 mm. Three input ranges (4.5-18 V, 9-36 V, 18-75 V) each pair with six outputs: 5.1, 12, 15 or 24 V single, or ±12 V and ±15 V dual. The TMR 10-2415WI takes 9 to 36 V and gives 24 V at up to 416 mA, 88 % efficient. Input and output are separated by functional insulation tested at 1500 VDC; the flyback stage switches near 420 kHz, and the module has a remote on/off pin, short-circuit, overload and overvoltage protection.",
